ue }","            else if value.magnification < 0.8 { popped = false }","        }","    )"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The pop is the point: a discrete state the gesture toggles, animated with a spring — not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a scale that tracks your fingers continuously."}]},{"text":"How it’s built","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"How-its-built"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The full view sits the white rounded triangle on the magenta artboard and adds a live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"@GestureState","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so the shape follows your fingers mid-pinch before it settles on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"popped state. Read the source (below) for the whole thing."}]},{"text":"Behavior","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Behavior"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pinch out on the shape to grow it; pinch in to shrink it.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cross the threshold and it snaps to the next size with a spring, rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking your fingers continuously.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The switch remembers its state, so a release between pinches holds the current size.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Downloads","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Downloads"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift sample"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swamikit\/swami\/blob\/development\/app\/Swami\/Patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.swift"},{"text":" — the full source. Read it to see how the pop maps to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoic